WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.725
Rubbing moves electrons from one material to the other.

2
00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:09.001
Both start neutral: every atom has a plus and a minus that cancel.

3
00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:18.572
Electrons move from the wool to the balloon. The positives stay put.

4
00:00:19.073 --> 00:00:22.798
Wool is plus three, balloon is minus three. They attract.

5
00:00:24.716 --> 00:00:28.416
Touch metal and the extra electrons rush back: a spark.
